{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/extras/0ecd82533219191b1601834e68550d3c.avif?t=1769155689\" width=826 height=185 /></span> Build and restore your own street in this cozy management game set in Meiji-era Japan. Design and customize buildings, manage charming cat-run shops, and create harmony between traditional and modern feline villagers to bring your street to life!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/extras/4f5f3080e8eb3584eea7bec7c74a3463.avif?t=1769155689\" width=833 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through each chapter to unlock charming new buildings inspired by both traditional and modern Meiji-era architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/extras/96725f156e47ec5e9d3d2fbcf50a65f2.avif?t=1769155689\" width=861 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your buildings by changing their colors, shapes, and designs to create a street that reflects your unique style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/extras/ef0fc26f242ef45a043b7e0f96c8955f.avif?t=1769155689\" width=814 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance material costs, prices, and customer needs to keep your cat-run shops thriving and profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/extras/38f583313f0f4bd559eb787afa1053fc.avif?t=1769155689\" width=881 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a peaceful community by maintaining harmony between traditional and modern cat villagers, ensuring everyone feels at home.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083580?t=1769155689","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083580?t=1769155689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/a820ce5f3715cd848dc92922747dba816d0c8e66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769155689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/a820ce5f3715cd848dc92922747dba816d0c8e66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769155689","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/extras/0ecd82533219191b1601834e68550d3c.avif?t=1769155689\" width=826 height=185 /></span> Build and restore your own street in this cozy management game set in Meiji-era Japan. Design and customize buildings, manage charming cat-run shops, and create harmony between traditional and modern feline villagers to bring your street to life!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/extras/4f5f3080e8eb3584eea7bec7c74a3463.avif?t=1769155689\" width=833 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through each chapter to unlock charming new buildings inspired by both traditional and modern Meiji-era architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/extras/96725f156e47ec5e9d3d2fbcf50a65f2.avif?t=1769155689\" width=861 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your buildings by changing their colors, shapes, and designs to create a street that reflects your unique style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/extras/ef0fc26f242ef45a043b7e0f96c8955f.avif?t=1769155689\" width=814 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance material costs, prices, and customer needs to keep your cat-run shops thriving and profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/extras/38f583313f0f4bd559eb787afa1053fc.avif?t=1769155689\" width=881 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a peaceful community by maintaining harmony between traditional and modern cat villagers, ensuring everyone feels at home.</p>","developers":["Eternal Dream","Eggtato "],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083580/6f2dc090fd21772e101fc404ac88ca767e508013/header.jpg?t=1769155689","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4083580/1954292380/12435d174703f6795a8163759fd742bff7563dac/1762775103/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762775690","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4083580/1954292380/12435d174703f6795a8163